 calls. Jackson has vastly out-raised Bottoms, but headlines about him skipping debates and a Medicaid-focused policy fight keep the race volatile. Everything points to a coin-flip finish with a slight Democratic tilt.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6414, "margin": 1.75}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5561, "margin": 0.5}]}